  "integrationsTokenStep1_jira": "Sign in to the Atlassian account agnts should act as, and open Account settings → Security → API tokens (or use the button below).",
  "integrationsTokenStep2_jira": "Click Create API token (not the one with scopes), name it (for example agnts) and pick an expiration date.",
